    "head_commit_message": "docs(decisions): Decisions 152 to 154, spec 39: the simulation in Rust (Q33)\n\nThe whole of sim/ moves to a Godot-free Rust crate, and Godot presents it.\nSquads move into the crate first, then the phases port in identical chunks.\nThe crate owns the content schema (JSON, written by the designer). The\nsimulation's tests move to cargo, one phase at a time on a built or\nsnapshot state. Spec 38 keeps step 2b and drops steps 1d and 2; spec 39\ntakes over its steps 3 and 4.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015mijTZhFycJQ9JhKAuvLBF",
